---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Testimonials | Jorge Mir Alvarez"
  description="What colleagues and collaborators say about working with Jorge Mir Alvarez."
  canonicalURL="https://jmiralva.me/testimonials"
>
  <!-- Testimonials Section -->
  <main class="testimonials">
    <div class="testimonials-header">
      <span class="section-label">Testimonials</span>
      <h1>Nice things people have said about me or what it's like to work with me.</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="testimonials-grid">
      <blockquote class="testimonial testimonial-1">
        <p>"Jorge is a driving force behind many improvements on the PM team. Some are behind the scenes, which help our team operate smoothly. Others are big & experimental. I'm consistently impressed by the thoughtfulness and thoroughness that he brings to his work."</p>
        <footer>
          <cite class="testimonial-name"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/vickyvolvovski/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vicky Volvovski</a></cite>
          <span class="testimonial-role">Head of Product, Conduit Tech</span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>

      <blockquote class="testimonial testimonial-2">
        <p>"An incredibly skilled product thinker, strategist, and lead — one of the best I've worked with."</p>
        <footer>
          <cite class="testimonial-name"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/closacco/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Chris LoSacco</a></cite>
          <span class="testimonial-role">VP of Solution Architecture, Launch by NTT Data</span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>

      <blockquote class="testimonial testimonial-3">
        <p>"Jorge helped build this place. It truly would not have been the same Postlight without him and I'm grateful we got to work with him."</p>
        <footer>
          <cite class="testimonial-name"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ftrain/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Paul Ford</a></cite>
          <span class="testimonial-role">Co-Founder, Aboard / CEO, Postlight</span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>

      <blockquote class="testimonial testimonial-4">
        <p>"Jorge is a thoughtful leader and good at identifying problems from their origin and addressing them. Anyone would be lucky to have him on their team!"</p>
        <footer>
          <cite class="testimonial-name"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/vinod-periasamy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vinod Persiasamy</a></cite>
          <span class="testimonial-role">Senior Engineering Manager, Multi Media, LLC</span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>

      <blockquote class="testimonial testimonial-5">
        <p>"Jorge was clear with me about process, expectations, and scope. He was flexible, open to suggestions and feedback, and yet it was clear he knew how to deliver results. His attention to detail, expansive product knowledge, strategic thinking, and clear project management made him someone I would be thankful to work with time and time again."</p>
        <footer>
          <cite class="testimonial-name"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/gsunnell/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Grace Sunnell</a></cite>
          <span class="testimonial-role">Principal Product Designer, Slack</span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>

      <blockquote class="testimonial testimonial-6">
        <p>"Jorge is an outstanding product manager and a joy to work with. As a UX researcher, I was deeply impressed by Jorge's ability to take stock of a business problem, and weave together a strategy that included customer research, technical requirements, and design needs. Jorge values the perspectives of his team: he listens attentively and implements changes thoughtfully."</p>
        <footer>
          <cite class="testimonial-name"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/bronwyn-larsen-81750242/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bronwyn Larsen</a></cite>
          <span class="testimonial-role">Senior UX Researcher, Zapier</span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>

      <blockquote class="testimonial testimonial-7">
        <p>"Jorge is an exceptional product thinker and is leaving behind a place that has grown tremendously as direct result of his collaboration and leadership. We really appreciate what he brought to Postlight, culturally, ethically and as a great practitioner."</p>
        <footer>
          <cite class="testimonial-name"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rich-ziade-a600221/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Rich Ziade</a></cite>
          <span class="testimonial-role">Co-Founder, Aboard / President, Postlight</span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>

      <blockquote class="testimonial testimonial-8">
        <p>"Jorge was a voice of reason during our short timeline. He pulled us back when we were over-ambitious and directed the project scope to a manageable place. He was very thoughtful with his feedback as we worked through the many small design details."</p>
        <footer>
          <cite class="testimonial-name"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/possehl/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Andrew Possehl</a></cite>
          <span class="testimonial-role">Product Designer, Meta</span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>

      <blockquote class="testimonial testimonial-9">
        <p>"Jorge is a great listener, mentor, and people / product manager. I've learned a lot from him, and I'm grateful for how he has advocated for me."</p>
        <footer>
          <cite class="testimonial-name"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/lindseyfogle/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Lindsey Fogle</a></cite>
          <span class="testimonial-role">Group Product Manager, Discourse</span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>

      <blockquote class="testimonial testimonial-10">
        <p>"Jorge has played a key role in improving the Developer Platform team's own processes, as well as relationships with internal and external stakeholders."</p>
        <footer>
          <cite class="testimonial-name"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/fokkezb/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Fokke Zandbergen</a></cite>
          <span class="testimonial-role">Staff Engineer, Zapier</span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
